    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Choose Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner:</strong> Blend into the environment, build your escape, and survive the timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catcher:</strong> Hunt down all Runners before time\u2019s up. Watch as structures decay and the map reveals their secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator:</strong> Sit back and enjoy the chaos, or study others while you wait for your next round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728\u00a0Transform into Props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/cf69dd964af8104e5b947b2e6bfe88fe.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/cf69dd964af8104e5b947b2e6bfe88fe.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/cf69dd964af8104e5b947b2e6bfe88fe.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend into your surroundings by transforming into almost any object. Outwit your enemies with perfect disguises and unexpected movements.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 Build to Outsmart</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/fa95527471d6692cf6fb1ebae6bce569.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/fa95527471d6692cf6fb1ebae6bce569.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/fa95527471d6692cf6fb1ebae6bce569.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place walls, stairs, and clever structures to reach new spots or block your pursuers. Fast-paced and temporary \u2014 build smart, build quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Power Orbs \u2013 Turn the Tide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e76b02b33a0c53e6fd6734fab72f1a46.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e76b02b33a0c53e6fd6734fab72f1a46.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/e76b02b33a0c53e6fd6734fab72f1a46.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect special orbs across the map to gain temporary abilities. Stun enemies, teleport, reveal hidden players, or sabotage builds \u2014 the chaos is yours to control!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Express Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/6b4f5ecc9ab4d38e0faf7ad44235984b.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/6b4f5ecc9ab4d38e0faf7ad44235984b.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/6b4f5ecc9ab4d38e0faf7ad44235984b.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fun cosmetics, costumes, emotes, and effects from the in-game store. Personalize your character to stand out or blend in \u2014 your style, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Explore and Hide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/467f8919a8bec81bffbc24e7a1dca5cd.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/467f8919a8bec81bffbc24e7a1dca5cd.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/467f8919a8bec81bffbc24e7a1dca5cd.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is filled with unique hiding spots, tricky terrain, and secrets. Whether you're running or chasing, map knowledge is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50 Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide &amp; Seek Reimagined</strong> \u2013 Multiplayer chaos where players become props or hunters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Building</strong> \u2013 Use simple structures to change the flow of every round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Abilities</strong> \u2013 Power orbs keep matches unpredictable and wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong> \u2013 Style your character with unlockable outfits, effects, and emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Maps</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and strategic hiding spots in handcrafted environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Fun</strong> \u2013 No match is ever the same, thanks to player creativity and dynamic tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supports 5\u201315 Players</strong> \u2013 Ideal for parties, streams, or competitive hide-and-seek lovers.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><br><strong>SeekOut\u00a0</strong>is a fast-paced, multiplayer hide-and-seek game where players are split into two teams: <strong>Runners</strong> try to hide, escape, and survive, while <strong>Catchers</strong> hunt them down. You can also join as a <strong>Spectator</strong> to watch and learn from your friends\u2019 strategies!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Choose Your Role</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.webm?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/4ff40c74eef3fa46aad56ccc243c2207.mp4?t=1755259373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runner:</strong> Blend into the environment, build your escape, and survive the timer!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catcher:</strong> Hunt down all Runners before time\u2019s up. Watch as structures decay and the map reveals their secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectator:</strong> Sit back and enjoy the chaos, or study others while you wait for your next round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728\u00a0Transform into Props</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768140/extras/cf69dd964af8104e5b947b2e6bfe88fe.poster.avif?t=1755259373\" wid